OL,3,AFake nuclear warnings issued after
OL,4,AUkrainian and Russian air alert apps
OL,5,Ahacked
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine and Russia have both said air
OL,8,Falert apps were hacked on Sunday night
OL,9,Fafter fake messages warning of attacks,
OL,10,Fincluding nuclear, were sent to users.
OL,12,FUkraine's widely used app sent
OL,13,Fred-level air raid warnings across the
OL,14,Fcountry, with additional warnings of
OL,15,Fradiation, chemical attacks, and street
OL,16,Ffighting sent to some residents in
OL,17,Fareas including Kyiv.
OL,19,FA few hours later, Russian authorities
OL,20,Fsaid a similar app was hacked after
OL,21,Ffake alerts, some of which contained
OL,22,Ffoul language, were triggered.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
